              "raw_markup": "<p>P.S | About sending the eggs, the best way would be to send them by Deliverance Co<sup>y</sup>. (or if not safe, by hand, &amp; I can repay you) addressed exactly as follows. diag C. Darwin Esq.</p>\n"
